1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,865
O say, can you see

2
00:00:03,865 --> 00:00:08,000
by the dawn's early light

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:12,500
What so proudly we hailed

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:16,600
at the twilight's last gleaming?

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,910
Whose broad stripes and bright stars

6
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:25,100
through the perilous fight,

7
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:29,400
O'er the ramparts we watched,

8
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:33,700
were so gallantly streaming?

9
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:38,100
And the rockets' red glare,

10
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:42,500
the bombs bursting in air,

11
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:47,000
Gave proof through the night

12
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:51,000
that our flag was still there;

13
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,000
O say does that star-spangled

14
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:02,366
banner yet wave,

15
00:01:02,366 --> 00:01:08,700
O'er the land of the free

16
00:01:08,700 --> 00:01:17,100
and the home of the brave?